  "details": "[1]\n\nCurrently the OSC camera requires the users camera UI to be open and doesn't accept  control commands when the UI is hidden during spout mode\n\n[2]\n\nWhen issuing position updates to the camera (or almost any of the osc cam controls) fly mode gets toggled on and we have to toggle it off every frame for continuous movement\n\nThis seems like a bug and makes it very awkward to use the osc position setting when also moving in-game.",
